Foreign Visit Management System in the Department of Agricultural Research Education(DARE) / Krishi Anusandhan Bhawan (KAB HQs) / ICAR Institutes. Changes were recommended by the former Director, Department of Agricultural Research Education (DARE), Dr. R. C. Agarwal. Earlier, when the Section Officer or Assistant was on leave, the entire file movement process was abandoned. Therefore, the complete flowchart was provided to us in document format. All recommended changes were successfully completed by the team. PI: Dr. Mukesh Kumar
